  "title": "Donegal Group Inc. Announces Release Date for Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "MARIETTA, Pa., July 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Donegal Group Inc. (NASDAQ:DGICA) and (NASDAQ:DGICB) announced today that it plans to release its results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, on Thursday, July 30, 2026, before the opening of regular trading on the NASDAQ Stock Market.",
